flowchart TD
    Launcher[Project launcher] -->|Create new project| Create[Name, destination and blank/template]
    Launcher -->|Select one of four examples| Template[Choose template and destination]
    Template --> Create
    Launcher -->|Open project| Picker[Native existing-project picker]
    Launcher -->|Select recent row| Check{Project available and valid?}
    Picker --> Check
    Picker -->|Cancel| Launcher
    Check -->|Yes| Overview[Project overview]
    Check -->|Missing or invalid| Recovery[Locate, retry or remove recent entry]
    Recovery --> Check
    Recovery --> Launcher
    Create -->|Cancel| Launcher
    Create -->|Validate and create| Overview
    Overview --> Build[Build strategy]
    Overview --> Data[Register compatible data/profile]
    Build --> Backtest[Configure backtest draft]
    Data --> Backtest
    Backtest --> Preflight{Inputs ready?}
    Preflight -->|Repair| Backtest
    Preflight -->|Freeze inputs and start| Job[Running job and logs]
    Job -->|Complete| Results[Saved run: chart, trades and metrics]
    Job -->|Failed/canceled/interrupted| Outcome[Honest outcome and recovery]
    Outcome --> Backtest
    Results --> Optimize[Optimize candidate]
    Optimize --> Validate[Validate frozen candidate]
    Results --> Report[Report saved evidence]
    Validate --> Report
    Results -->|Change draft: retain old run identity| Backtest
    Overview -->|Switch project| Launcher
